msgstr "本機橋接程式"

msgid "Native host is ready. Finish installing the extension in your browser profile."
msgstr "本機橋接程式已就緒。請繼續在瀏覽器個人資料中完成擴充功能安裝。"

msgid "Native host needs registration or repair."
msgstr "本機橋接程式需要註冊或修復。"

msgid "Native host registered. Continue with the extension steps below."
msgstr "已註冊本機橋接程式。請繼續依下方步驟安裝擴充功能。"

msgid "Network and schedule"
msgstr "網路與排程"

msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

msgid "No checksum"
msgstr "無校驗檔"

