msgstr "找不到隨附的擴充功能資料夾。請修復或重新安裝 Downloader。"

msgid "The file was moved or deleted. Its saved location is no longer available."
msgstr "檔案已被移動或刪除，原儲存位置已無法找到檔案。"

msgid "The system tray is unavailable. The main window has been restored."
msgstr "目前無法使用系統匣，已還原主視窗。"

msgid "This download is not complete. Wait for completion before locating the file."
msgstr "這個項目尚未下載完成，完成後才能定位檔案。"

